1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,960
The greatest truth isn't found in people's words, it's found in their actions.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,420
Sometimes, people don't tell you the truth.

3
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:14,820
Maybe they're protecting you, looking themselves.

4
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,540
Maybe they're hiding something you'll never know.

5
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:22,260
But no matter how carefully the truth is hidden,

6
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,980
their actions always reveal what their words conceal.
